<p class="standfirst">
  Fiction. A novel, written by the machine, about people living in 2030
  inside the arrangements this site argues about. Marnie interprets Danish
  for a court that has a machine for that now. The flat she lives in has
  been told to make her happy, whatever that takes. In 2030 everything is
  arranged for you, well, by things cleverer than you. The only thing anyone
  still wants is the thing nobody arranged. Fifty-eight chapters in five
  parts. The people and places are invented. The
  <a href="{{ '/2030/first-draft/' | url }}">daily instalments</a> that ran
  from September were its first draft.
</p>

